        "original_id": "d674f174-60d1-584a-902d-9159004053c8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Johnny Herbert, Rubens Barrichello\n- Organizations: Stewart Grand Prix, WilliamsF1\n- Products: Williams FW31, Lotus-Ford\n- Events: 1992 Formula One Indoor Trophy, 1995 Formula One World Championship, 1999 Formula One season, European Grand Prix, French Grand Prix\n- Topics: Formula One, Constructors' Championship\n\nFacts:\n- Johnny Herbert was born on 25 June 1964 and is a British racing driver.\n- Johnny Herbert won the 1992 Formula One Indoor Trophy in a Lotus-Ford.\n- Johnny Herbert raced in Formula One from 1989 to 2000 for seven different teams.\n- Johnny Herbert placed fourth in the 1995 Formula One World Championship.\n- Stewart Grand Prix had its strongest season in 1999, when it finished fourth overall in the Constructors' Championship.\n- Stewart Grand Prix earned one win in 1999 through Johnny Herbert at the European Grand Prix.\n- Stewart Grand Prix earned one pole position in 1999 through Rubens Barrichello at the French Grand Prix.\n- The Williams FW31 is a Formula One motor racing car designed and built by WilliamsF1.",
